OL,3,GNEWSAThe woman with an 'up to 100%
OL,4,Achance' of developing cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHannah Simpson has been told by doctors
OL,7,Fthat she has an "up to 100% chance" of
OL,8,Fdeveloping hereditary cancer.
OL,10,FThe 32-year-old lost her mum Jeanette
OL,11,FSimpson to the disease in 2022, and her
OL,12,Flate granddad Terry Cook also had
OL,13,Fhereditary cancer.
OL,15,FShe said: "It's hard enough losing
OL,16,Fsomebody, but then to have lost that
OL,17,Fperson to something that was caused by
OL,18,Fthe same mutation that you carry, it
OL,19,Fkind of hits you again."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
