OL,3,GNEWSAThe woman with an 'up to 100%
OL,4,Achance' of developing cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrying to make light of her situation,
OL,7,FHannah now jokes each year with her
OL,8,Fconsultant that it might be time to
OL,9,Fhave "that chat" with a surgeon, and
OL,10,Fundergo life-altering surgery to save
OL,11,Fher life.
